  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.8 targets Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.1 and retires the rejected Yone V5 presentation without changing Q/W/R gameplay or the saved-season floor introduced in 0.10.5. V5 passed native-frame pixel checks but still looked unclear because card and compact UI surfaces enlarged the same 43x55 battle pixels. V6 therefore uses source-direct high-resolution UI art instead of deriving UI presentation from the tiny battle idle, while rebuilding the native battle actions from zero from the same V6 model identity. The battle atlas keeps the official 3502x88 canvas, 13 animation tags, rectangles, labels and timings, and Q/W/R effects, icons and audio remain unchanged. Spirit Cleave still performs one stateless 80-degree, 42000-range GameCtx cone scan, deals 35 + 45% Attack + 6% target maximum-health physical damage, and settles one shield tier for zero through five champions hit; Mod API 0.8 still requires fixed 0.5-second cast and 8-second cooldown. Retired E and 0.10.4 rectangular-W native names remain no-op saved-data compatibility only so old embedded trees do not crash after BP. Automated source and build checks do not constitute live visual acceptance; V6 remains pending in-game user verification.",
